  "description": "Learn to write 2,141 kanji with your pen, covering every jōyō kanji: the kanji of Basic Kanji Book and Intermediate Kanji Book (Vols. 1 and 2 of each), then two Advanced levels of themed lessons. Stroke-order animations, tracing, writing from memory with stroke-by-stroke checking, and spaced reviews.",
